{"articleNo":"196191","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=196191&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"청량리역~강릉역간 KTX 50% 특별할인 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.08.13","hit":"4534","attachments":[{"name":"E-train 상품소개.zip","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=196191&attachNo=78870"},{"name":"영미컬링 체험열차.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=196191&attachNo=78942"},{"name":"청량리~강릉력 간 KTX 운임 50% 특별할인 안내문.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=196191&attachNo=78970"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">코레일은 대학생들이 저렴하게 KTX를 이용할수 있도록 다음과 같이 KTX 운임을 특별할인하오니 학생들의 많은 이용 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 다&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 음&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">가. 할인구간&nbsp;: 청량리역 ~ 강릉역 간 KTX 열차</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">나. 할인율 : KTX 운임의 50%&nbsp;이상 할인(청량리 ~ 강릉 간 4명이서 5만원에 이용)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">다. 할인조건 :&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">① 4명이</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 함께 이용</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">② 코레일톡 어플 설치</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">③ 코레일멤버십 회원가입</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">라. 할인기간 : 2018. 8. 6. ~ 2018. 12. 31. (추석 특별 수송 기간 제외)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">마. 할인승차권 구입 : 반드시 스마트폰 코레일톡 어플로 구입(역 창구에서는 불가)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">※ 30일전부터 예매 가능 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">→ 여유있게 미리 예매해야 원하는 날짜</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">·신간대 열차표 구입에 유리</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">바. 구입방법 : ① 스마트폰에 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">「코레일톡 어플</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">」설치</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ② 코레일멤버십 회원가입 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ③ 코레일톡 초기화면 맨 하단 \"정기</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">·할인권</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">\" 메뉴 선택</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ④ \"함께하는 특가상품\" 메뉴 선택</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;⑤ \"넷이서 5만원\" 메뉴 선택 후, 예매</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ** 추천여행지 : 오대산월정사/대관령양떼목장/바다부채길/주문진/안목커피거리 등</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p>